/*
 * Standalone boundary harness for CVE-2019-14895 mwifiex country-IE guard.
 *
 * This does NOT compile the kernel module. It models the exact copy arithmetic
 * of the vulnerable and patched mwifiex_process_country_ie() bodies so the
 * guard boundary (IEEE80211_COUNTRY_STRING_LEN + MWIFIEX_MAX_TRIPLET_802_11D)
